{
  "_readme": [
    "The VinWonders / Vinpearl partner catalogue. scripts/seed-vinwonders.mjs reads this file.",
    "FILL IN affiliateUrl, priceFromVnd and images for each destination — the script SKIPS any",
    "entry missing them rather than publishing a broken listing.",
    "affiliateUrl: the tracked deeplink from the AccessTrade generator for THAT destination.",
    "  The one supplied on 2026-08-24 (Phu Quoc VinWonders) is filled in as the worked example.",
    "priceFromVnd: the lowest adult ticket price, in VND, as an integer. Never USD — displaying a",
    "  price in USD is sanctionable under ND 340/2025.",
    "images: absolute URLs on our own storage (sb.eno.vn). Partner creatives must be uploaded",
    "  there first; a remote host would be blocked by img-src and would not survive a CSP change.",
    "THE HAVEN SUNSET TOUR and Vinpearl Horse Academy were removed on owner instruction (2026-08-24) — the partner supplied no affiliate link for either.",
    "bookingCode records the VinWonders `code=` each affiliate link resolved to on 2026-08-24 (checked by following all 17 shorteners). It is DOCUMENTATION, not an enforced check — nothing in the seed re-resolves the links, so if a short link is re-pointed at a different attraction this file will not notice. Re-run scripts/verify-vinwonders-links.ts to compare them again.",
    "priceFromVnd is a FROM price supplied by the owner (2026-08-24), not scraped: VinWonders sets the real price per date at checkout. discountCode/discountPercent are PER PRODUCT — they differ across the catalogue (MEMBER10, MEMBER3, MEMBER2, SHOW5), so they live on the listing, not on the partner. Where a product has none, the partner-wide code on Seller is used instead.",
    "partner.discountCode is intentionally NULL. XINCHAO (5%) was supplied as a general offer before the per-product codes arrived, and three products have no code of their own — using XINCHAO for those would print a code the partner may reject at checkout. Set it only if the partner confirms it is valid catalogue-wide; the PDP does not fall back to it in any case."
  ],
